{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a148efe2cc2973b67a2c6e619d1a894b91eca3312bc93c1d30ff5b8814e04c2", "ja": "（PV撮影の休憩時間。千鶴さんがふらりと\n姿を消したので、後を追ってみることにした……）", "zh": "（PV拍摄的休息时间。千鹤小姐突然悄悄离开了，于是我决定跟上去看看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b2254d80cf4d525083cdee21a6ae2fc4b97deefe0ba881826d2e4b9aaa2e76e6", "ja": "あ、いたいた……千鶴さん、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，在这儿啊……千鹤小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "d4c5e063da4fe9978f1e59d4907b4a9a53da3cedb0cb5e22cc2550893c40d4f9", "ja": "あら、{$P$}……。\nもしかして、もうそろそろ撮影開始でしたかしら？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}……\n难不成，马上就要开始拍摄了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9cf2652ae9ec05c5105a054a162be807e29f80a87e8fd5baeba00a2eac47e396", "ja": "いや、まだです。ただ、何処に行くのか気になった\nだけで……お邪魔だったら、すみません。", "zh": "不，还没呢。只是有点好奇您要去哪里……\n要是打扰到您了，我很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "6d14b1d0af311ee07005cc0202cac802c15fc2b3c124d2bd6beeb051a0f2da9e", "ja": "いえ、そんなことは……別になんでもありませんわ。\nなんとなく月が見たくなっただけです。", "zh": "不是，没那回事……没什么特别的。\n只是突然想看看月亮而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3f1dfcfe7f3d3d9e9cd19955907a76a06c20c3fa338bd56c42f3a100ef8953f9", "ja": "なんとなくですか。\nまあ、わかります。今夜は月が綺麗に見えますし。", "zh": "只是想看看月亮吗？嗯，我能理解。今晚的月亮确实很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "5c0c6a427010226622af78de33bb0057e11f5e28dd095e9ab406d736d9e53b24", "ja": "ええ……思い返してみれば\n受験の頃はよくこうして、月を見上げたものでした。", "zh": "嗯……回想起来，备考那段时间经常会像这样仰望月亮来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "9d60384e7ae3911dbde1e98e51726da12da733d6869a4a1e5c1138a0c4fadda9", "ja": "勉強で、学校からの帰りが遅くなった日などは、\n自転……", "zh": "因为学习，放学回家晚了的时候，就会自转……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "f2b847e872bf18f35e6d7638f882c35b9d21f3ccb55440da66c21df9c708b4d9", "ja": "そ、そう！　自転する月がよく見えたものですわ！\n送迎の車の窓から……お～っほっほっほ！", "zh": "对、对！没错！那时经常能清楚地看到自转的月亮呢！  \n从接送车的车窗里……哦——呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "747c887e2605b94bda01e49850859d3978db2cbe61260e35511b781cc16314b5", "ja": "え？　あ、ええ……確か月って、\n自転と公転の速度が、ピッタリ同じらしいですね。", "zh": "诶？啊，是的……我记得月亮的自转和公转速度，听说好像正好一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "51270f73d2c74111c8297398edf99312a60f4377bf5bd5874ead9a425c3f9377", "ja": "あ、それは聞き覚えがありますわね。\nですから月は、いつも表側しか見えないのだとか。", "zh": "啊，这个我好像听说过呢。所以，据说我们总是只能看到月亮的正面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "5dde5a38edfcb2a8b88782cfd1d42b94eadbabd9382eece86110b21338e51baa", "ja": "ただ変わらず、そこにあって。\n美しく磨かれた面だけを、こちらに見せてくれる。", "zh": "只是始终不变地存在于那里，\n只将那美丽而光洁的一面展现在我们面前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "128118c6a8c3b6015581f31bf8d932b1412768bae06416395149e25577f93073", "ja": "わたくしも、あの月のようになれたらと……。\nそんなことを考えてしまいますわ。", "zh": "我也忍不住会想……\n要是自己也能像那轮明月一样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d6fdfd35a132d13328390285dd93c9515274dcfa0a71b27a2441a45816930b9c", "ja": "ええと、それは……？", "zh": "那个……怎么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "a43fa4d8a2db86054cf03164e5e08b6e53763464d0e9fbee1706ce2831b2ce50", "ja": "あ、いえ！　あの月のように美しく……などと、\n傲慢なことを言いたいわけではありませんのよ！？", "zh": "啊，不是！我并不是想说自己美得像那轮明月……这种傲慢的话哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "da6b6b1e247d2055d2ff018e0531a379bb18d62e4954e44c429310b1e479c5fc", "ja": "ただ、わたくしにも、誰にも見せない裏側が、\nないことも、ない……かもしれませんもの！", "zh": "只是，我也不是没有不让任何人看到的另一面……也许吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "b577b0de9f57df8da925f4d44df71b1801c6093913fd6c94f55c773ee8dcc260", "ja": "本当の姿を隠しながらも、堂々と輝く……。\nそんな強さには、憧れてしまいますわね。", "zh": "即使隐藏着真实的自己，也能堂堂正正地闪耀……这样的坚强，实在令人向往呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5d924b92cb4a42ade33483725d8c622dc54c961e2ca8d3f0dc4d684cf021d4b4", "ja": "なるほど……さすがですね、千鶴さん！\nそこまで役柄に入り込んでいるなんて。", "zh": "原来如此……不愧是千鹤小姐！\n没想到你已经完全融入角色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "abf349837c3e13c69b4d4275b9e2f26f6e40a31b974e2f6939d6333ccfb48271", "ja": "イメージトレーニング中、という事ですよね？\nPVの役柄の……。", "zh": "你是说，正在进行形象训练，对吧？\n是关于PV中的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "27a289f9381bf99bc2d0392b1782fdc75bc50ce614707dee2f0c9537acf06c5e", "ja": "あ……え、ええ！　その通りですわ！\n偽りの仮面、隠された心に思い悩む貴婦人……。", "zh": "啊……是、是的！正是如此！\n一位因虚伪的面具和隐藏的内心而苦恼的贵妇人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "eec808e4c2901846d718a8b3bf875ee2a308d468638420cb14d2ffaf255803c8", "ja": "かなり掴めてきましたわよ、わたくしの役柄が！\nお～っほっほっほっほ、ゲホッコホッ。", "zh": "我已经相当抓住自己这个角色的感觉了！\n哦——呵呵呵呵，咳咳咳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c67e8392519231ee20c944cd1985a4aefedc54a87ee65ce09d4c871a764c0b73", "ja": "頼もしいですね。何かあれば言ってください。\nどんなことでも、協力しますよ！", "zh": "真让人放心。有任何事请告诉我。无论什么，我都会帮忙的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "8ea3e9b84ea126eecb6589beb5d62663561892379afac95b1d0527b441691883", "ja": "まあ、ふふっ……貴方らしい気遣いですのね。\nそうですわね、では……。", "zh": "哎呀，呵呵……这还真是像您的体贴呢。\n也是呢，那么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0244_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "cf8bd78d8be80675cfb9e5ede9ed13c1dc06031a9c6654a4b0b7649dd014fe23", "ja": "もうしばらく、一緒に月を見てくださいませんこと？\nイメージトレーニングとして……。", "zh": "能再陪我看一会儿月亮吗？\n就当作是意象训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
